1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,098
Plants can make new plants without any sex at all.

2
00:00:03,098 --> 00:00:08,046
A potato tuber is a swollen stem, and every eye is a bud.

3
00:00:08,046 --> 00:00:12,135
Plant it, and each bud grows into a new plant.

4
00:00:12,135 --> 00:00:17,447
The leaf of Bryophyllum sprouts little plantlets right along its edge.

